{
  "name": "Weathered Repair Garage Frontage",
  "rationale": "Full-scale, freestanding garage frontage with a genuinely open 3 m-wide vehicle passage and 2.5 m clearance beneath the raised shutter rail. Concrete piers, narrow brick side panels and an overhead lintel carry the frontage without a floor, rear wall or infill across the opening. A partially exposed rolled shutter, galvanized guides, faded blank sign, electrical enclosure and clipped service pipes provide readable industrial detail. Broad material variation and restrained sign wear remain legible at approximately 25 m.",
